sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / Browser
    participant Server as Backend Web App (Confidential)
    participant KC as Keycloak (Auth Server)
    
    User->>Server: Requests protected page
    Server->>KC: Redirects user to Keycloak login
    User->>KC: Authenticates successfully
    KC->>Server: Redirects with auth `code`
    Server->>KC: POST /token (code + Client Secret)
    Note over Server,KC: Secret proves backend identity
    KC->>Server: Returns Tokens (Access, ID, Refresh)
    Server->>User: Sets session cookie & renders page
